    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Cocktail Girl Service!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of an inexperienced manager who has just inherited a cozy cafe from his ancestor. And an unpayable debt to boot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to hire and develop waitresses, improve your cafe and seat guests in the cafe hall. The days are depressing with their routine, but in the evenings you can go on dates with beautiful girls and develop relationships with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to stay afloat in this capitalist world and get closer to the girls to find out their dreams. Who knows where the fulfillment of their desires will lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u00a0Complex, at first glance, management of your waitresses and the working day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u00a0Managing a cafe is not just a routine job, but a strategic undertaking, where every step has weight and every guest is important. In the end, work only warms up interest in the evening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u00a0Feel the excitement of getting maximum profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u00a0Immerse yourself in many short stories! All girls are unique, with their own character traits and dreams. Each date holds surprises, because as you get to know the girls better, you will discover new sides of their personalities and stories. Get to know them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 The dates are written in a text novella with spicy pictures.</p>",
